{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-54-1","title":"Isaiah 54:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, for the comfort of the Gentiles, prophesies the amplitude of their church; 4 their safety; 6 their certain deliverance out of affliction; 11 their fair edification; 15 and their sure preservation.</p>\n<p>O barren. 62:4; So 8:8; Ga 4:27 break. 42:10,11; 44:23; 49:13; 55:12,13; Ps 67:3-5; 98:3-9; Zep 3:14 Zec 9:9; Re 7:9,10 for more. 1Sa 2:5; Ps 113:9; Heb 11:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-54-2","title":"Isaiah 54:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>33:20; 49:19,20; Jer 10:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-54-3","title":"Isaiah 54:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thou shalt. 2:2-4; 11:9-12; 35:1,2; 42:1-12; 43:5,6; 49:12; 60:3-11; Ge 49:10 Ps 72:8-11; Ro 9:25,26; 10:18; 11:12; Col 1:23 and thy. 49:18; 55:5; 60:10-13; 61:5-9 make. 49:8,19; 52:9; Eze 36:35,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-54-4","title":"Isaiah 54:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Fear not. 41:10,14; 45:16,17; 61:7; 1Pe 2:6 thou shalt forget. Jer 31:19; Eze 16:22,43,60-63; Ho 3:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-54-5","title":"Isaiah 54:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thy Maker. Ps 45:10-17; Jer 3:14; Eze 16:8; Ho 2:19,20; Joh 3:29; 2Co 11:2,3 Eph 5:25-27,32 the Lord. 48:2; 51:15; Jer 10:16; 51:19; Lu 1:32 The God. Zec 14:9; Ro 3:29,30; Re 11:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-54-6","title":"Isaiah 54:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":54,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":54,"verseEnd":6},"conten